{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2040 World</strong> is a free-to-play third-person MMO action game with <strong>extraction-based gameplay</strong>. <br>You play as a mercenary operator, remotely controlling synthetic avatars used by powerful transnational corporations to explore a vast artificial megastructure simply known as <strong>The Station</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/extras/S1M2Poster.png?t=1750445341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Station</strong> is an entire world, created by an unknown advanced civilization for mysterious purposes. Explore its biomes, uncover rare minerals, study alien flora and fauna \u2014 and fight your way through hostile environments in pursuit of power and profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/extras/PosterCorpFight.png?t=1750445341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be warned: avatars are not immortal. If one is lost, you\u2019ll need to spend resources to build a new one. Master all <strong>five avatar classes</strong> to find the one that fits your playstyle.  <br>Discover over <strong>30 unique weapons</strong>, divided into <strong>three damage types</strong>, and mix and match armor pieces to achieve maximum protection in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/extras/WeaponsPoster.png?t=1750445341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The economy of <strong>2040 World</strong> thrives on player interaction. Use the in-game marketplace to trade resources, weapons, and gear \u2014 and strengthen your position in the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809260?t=1750445341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/7e88d050abf59380adb7bcbe170009297f727914/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750445341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/b70f1d576ca3309cc9cb32475ce4e9e7d4f10e1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750445341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/b70f1d576ca3309cc9cb32475ce4e9e7d4f10e1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750445341","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2040 World</strong> is a free-to-play third-person MMO action game with <strong>extraction-based gameplay</strong>. <br>You play as a mercenary operator, remotely controlling synthetic avatars used by powerful transnational corporations to explore a vast artificial megastructure simply known as <strong>The Station</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/extras/S1M2Poster.png?t=1750445341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Station</strong> is an entire world, created by an unknown advanced civilization for mysterious purposes. Explore its biomes, uncover rare minerals, study alien flora and fauna \u2014 and fight your way through hostile environments in pursuit of power and profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/extras/PosterCorpFight.png?t=1750445341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be warned: avatars are not immortal. If one is lost, you\u2019ll need to spend resources to build a new one. Master all <strong>five avatar classes</strong> to find the one that fits your playstyle.  <br>Discover over <strong>30 unique weapons</strong>, divided into <strong>three damage types</strong>, and mix and match armor pieces to achieve maximum protection in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/extras/WeaponsPoster.png?t=1750445341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The economy of <strong>2040 World</strong> thrives on player interaction. Use the in-game marketplace to trade resources, weapons, and gear \u2014 and strengthen your position in the world.</p>","developers":["2040WORLD GAMES PTE. LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809260/b5657fcf85cb7c14a890aec0b0d94fec54a6a672/header.jpg?t=1750445341","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157427,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157427/movie480.mp4?t=1750279543","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157427/movie_max.mp4?t=1750279543"},"name":"2040 Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157427/b66a0971721558034d0e2236663c3521938d6a4a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750279543","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157427/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750279543","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157427/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750279543"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257157398,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.